  app.innerHTML=`${back('resumen')}${steps(2)}<h1 style="font-size:38px">Pago seguro en sandbox</h1><div class="split"><section class="panel"><h2>Formulario de tarjeta (Sandbox)</h2><div class="alert"><p style="margin:0">Modo de pruebas activo. El número de tarjeta se tokeniza en tu navegador y nunca llega ni se almacena en nuestro servidor.</p></div><div class="test-cards" style="margin:16px 0"><p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px">Tarjetas de prueba:</p><div class="actions" style="margin:0"><button type="button" class="btn secondary small fill-card" data-card="4242424242424242" data-last4="4242">Aprobada (•••• 4242)</button><button type="button" class="btn secondary small fill-card" data-card="4000000000000002" data-last4="0002">Rechazo fondos (•••• 0002)</button><button type="button" class="btn secondary small fill-card" data-card="4000000000009999" data-last4="9999">Sin boletos RN-12 (•••• 9999)</button><button type="button" class="btn secondary small fill-card" data-card="4000000000000069" data-last4="0069">Aprobada, reembolso falla (•••• 0069)</button></div></div><form id="card-pay-form"><div class="field"><label for="card-holder">Nombre en la tarjeta</label><input id="card-holder" required value="${esc(user||'Comprador Demo')}" maxlength="80" autocomplete="cc-name"></div><div class="field"><label for="card-number">Número de tarjeta</label><input id="card-number" required placeholder="4242 •••• •••• 4242" value="4242 •••• •••• 4242" maxlength="19" autocomplete="cc-number"></div><div class="split" style="margin:0"><div class="field"><label for="card-exp">Vencimiento (MM/AA)</label><input id="card-exp" required placeholder="12/28" value="12/28" maxlength="5" autocomplete="cc-exp"></div><div class="field"><label for="card-cvc">CVC</label><input id="card-cvc" required placeholder="123" value="123" maxlength="4" autocomplete="cc-csc"></div></div>${legalSummary}<label class="inline-check" for="terms-refunds" style="margin:16px 0"><input id="terms-refunds" type="checkbox"><span>Acepto los <a href="#terminos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">términos</a>, la <a href="#reembolsos" target="_blank" rel="noopener">política de reembolsos</a> y el <a href="#privacidad" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aviso de privacidad</a>.</span></label><p class="error" id="payment-error" role="alert">${paymentError}</p><button class="btn" id="pay-btn" type="submit" style="width:100%" disabled>Confirmar pago de ${money(totalAmount)}</button></form></section><aside class="panel summary">${orderInfo()}<div class="line total" style="margin-top:12px"><span>Tiempo de reserva</span><strong id="payment-clock">${clockText(holdLeft())}</strong></div></aside></div>`;
